Buying interest returned after the recent correction, supported by strength in global markets. A key trigger for the afternoon rally was Finance Minister Nirmala Sitharaman’s comments on Long-Term Capital Gains (LTCG) tax and Securities Transaction Tax (STT), which raised hopes of a possible review. Adding to the positive momentum, the IT sector surged over 5 percent driven by strong quarterly results from HCLTech and TCS, making it one of the key contributors to the index’s recovery.
