Nifty is showing pullbacks from lower levels. For now, trend has shifted to buy on dips with the targets of 22,820 as long as 22,480 remains intact on the downside.
 Strategy : Buy Nifty Futures if it moves towards 22,630 to 22,650 and reverses with stop-loss of 22,520 and targets of 22,730-22,760 followed by 22,820.
 Rajesh Dashrath Bhosale, Fund Manager - Advisory at Renaissance 
