 Nifty Trading Plan for October 13, 2026 
 22,300 could act as immediate support, followed by 22,180, crucial swing-low support
 A decisive break below 22,180 could intensify selling pressure
 On upside, 22,500–22,600 zone is likely to act as immediate resistance
